# 📜 Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## [0.1.1]

### ✨ New Features
- **🎨 Themes**:
  - Added `mystical-hd` theme with new assets
  - New `mystical` theme with various improvements
  - `classic` theme renamed to `first-blood`
- **♟️ Gameplay**:
  - Implemented basic AI functionality: random moves + booking
  - Added game mode selection
  - Enhanced chess game with themes, timer, and victory messages
  - Added last move highlighting
  - Implemented `isCheck` and integrated it into move validation
  - Reworked and fixed en passant PGN handling
- **🖥️ UI/UX**:
  - Improved fantasy logo look & feel
  - Separate styles for player/opponent move suggestions
  - Enhanced selected square and valid move indicators
  - Added basic footer

### 🛠️ Improvements & Refactoring
- 🔧 Split entity and base entity logic
- ✏️ Improved global documentation
- ♻️ Renamed "piece" to "entity" in codebase
- 🏗️ Added production check, git ingest in Makefile
- 📈 Added version bump command in Makefile

### 🐛 Bug Fixes
- 🧹 Removed misplaced theme files
- ✍️ Fixed PGN move count display (now shows only once)
- 🛠️ Fixed Makefile dev setup

### 📚 Documentation
- 📝 Updated README with new screenshot
- 📖 Added Pawn implementation details
- 📑 Completed Makefile help section

## [Initial Release] - 2025-08-05

### 🎉 Initial Commit
- 🌱 Project initialization
- 🔒 Added SAST configuration in `.gitlab-ci.yml`